list.item:
Herres, Robert
                                T., Gen., USAF;
                        Vice Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff until February 28, 1990

person.note:
U.S. Ambassador to the Federal Republic of Germany until February 17, 1989;
                    Head of the U.S. Delegation to the Nuclear and Space Talks from June 15, 1989,
                    until March 31, 1991

Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Intelligence and Research until 1989;
                    Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for European and Canadian Affairs from
                    1989
